		"ItemTooltips"
		{
			"item_tango"		"If the lane will be tough - get more tangoes."
			"item_assault"		"Good armor aura and attack speed buff. Good thing to pick up if you don`t have it in your team and really need armor"
			"item_heart"		"Heart is that point of becoming out-of-control. It replaces any of your cheap regen items, while also making you very hard to kill in fights (not only because of HP pool, but also because of ability to get out, regen ad re-engage)."
			"item_black_king_bar"		"Almost all the time you WILL need to pick up BKB. It helps a lot against disables, break and a lot of other stuff."
			"item_vanguard"		"Gives a lot of tankiness and sustain, BUT doesn`t boost farming speed, while also being quite expensive.
Good for tower dives (and very agressive plays) or against summons/high attack speed."
			"item_blade_mail"		"~8 min
It`s both farming and fighting item. Works well with Radiance, but is very timing dependent
Alternatives: Radiance, Philactery"
			"item_radiance"		"~18-24 min
Radiance is the best farming item you can get, but it slows you down quite a bit. It`s better to get Soul Ring and Blade Mail most of the time (it will be enough for farming), but if you have a free early game and enough time to get Radiance then go for it.
Before Manta Style
ALTERNATIVES: Blade Mail, Philactery"
			"item_butterfly"		"A lot of attack speed, damage and miss chance. May be replaced by Bloodthorn if you have enough money."
			"item_manta"		"~25-32 min
Increases our farming speed by a lot, gives us a lot of damage against solo targets, increases tankiness by a little bit"
			"item_skadi"		"Gives a lot of stats and slow passive (which should work on illusions too), so it`s one of the best items to pick up actually"
			"item_abyssal_blade"		"Gives a lot of tankiness and good for locking people down. Most of the time you don`t really need it or just have more important slot to have. Altho, it`s actually pretty good as 6-7th slot."
			"item_power_treads"		"~7-10 min
Treads switch and raw tankiness may be halpful for Spectre in situations when you desperately need HP"
			"item_mask_of_madness"		"It has a fairly low cooldown and works well as regen item replacement and a farming item. You don`t really need to use it in fights, but you CAN if you need to focus a squishy target. It`s better to purchase with some cheap armor (like Blade Mail)"
			"item_falcon_blade"		"~5 min
Before Blade Mail
ALTERNATIVES: Urn of Shadows"
			"item_ultimate_scepter"		"~20-30 min"
			"item_hand_of_midas"		"~10 min
ALTERNATIVES: Meteor Hammer, Blade Mail"
			"item_mage_slayer"		"~15 min
"
			"item_orchid"		"ALTERNATIVE: Skull Basher"
			"item_urn_of_shadows"		"~5 min
Before Blade Mail
ALTERNATIVES: Falcon Blade"
			"item_phylactery"		"It works with Dagger and Step, it&amp;amp;apos;s generally nice for stats and farming. But it also practically takes the same niche as Radiance/BM, so it depends
Alternatives: Radiance, Blade Mail"
		}
